    "proximate_text": "The cause of the event was a mechanical fault internal to the breaker caused a high resistance connection to develop ultimately resulting in loss of the generator field. The internals of the breaker melted during the event destroying evidence. The internal damage prevented the identification of a specific sub-component failure including potential process, or programmatic causes associated with the sub-component maintenance, construction, or testing.",
    "cause_code": "TBD",
    "category": "provisional",
    "theme": "Undetermined breaker internal mechanical fault leading to high-resistance contact and fire",
    "provisional": true
  },
